{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Propagate JVM-fatal hook failures without waiting behind arbitrary cleanup.** After catching `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`, the loop still invokes every remaining end hook. If one blocks, the fatal never reaches the invocation caller. Rethrow JVM-fatal failures immediately, or make subsequent best-effort cleanup bounded.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77sb12","finding_digest":"c92b7c1747a290739ec238dd4ec3ebca21a44760e63e5f5597374768eeaf7d5f","finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","line":126,"observation_digest":"b64798768526b663d757beba72b20a59340c9134cee517777864d41054b0b40d","observation_id":"aro_v1_wzdzq5ufe23ghv2xx25hfmqkle","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","published_at":"2026-10-08T18:31:18Z","review_id":"arr_v1_3ad56x3tucxpdx6v3vndafnqmc","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"40597b3393d2260883ae37b45d978685d2144a31","reviewer":"codex","start_line":113,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_y5frtbksjboey77iyiqzktkqeb","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T18:31:18Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
